{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":498604,"name":"נדב אהרון","username":"NadavAharon","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-22T22:59:20.087Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eIm sad to report the lag still happens, ive been suffering feom it all day.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI even tried to do some minimal reproduction tests where i set up a routine that fires once every 5 minutes to just ping me.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe times i got the pings where:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2026-09-23 00:08:21 IDT\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003col start=\"2\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2026-09-23 00:29:45 IDT (~21 min after \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#1\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2026-09-23 00:43:18 IDT (~14 min after \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#2\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2026-09-23 01:01:54 IDT (~19 min after \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#3\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e2026-09-23 01:14:56 IDT (~13 min after \u003cspan class=\"hashtag-raw\"\u003e#4\u003c/span\u003e)\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNotice how these are way more then 5 minutes apart.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eAlso the first 1 is an hour late but whatever.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI really dont get it, you already gave each agent his own vm to work with, why cant it manage the routine internaly and avoid these queues? This is ridiculous\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":58,"post_type":1,"posts_count":29,"updated_at":"2026-09-22T22:59:20.087Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":2,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":16.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170358,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule","display_username":"נדב אהרון","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139314,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule/170358/58","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":498614,"name":"Andrew Simard","username":"Andrew_Simard","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/andrew_simard/{size}/120286_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-22T23:20:01.586Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003ePresumably because the VMs aren’t running when they’re not doing anything, hence no cron of their own. That’s what Grok tells me anyway \u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/fluentui/thinking.png?v=15\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e  The external poke with cron on a local machine works great though.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":59,"post_type":1,"posts_count":29,"updated_at":"2026-09-22T23:20:01.586Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":58,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":11.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170358,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule","display_username":"Andrew Simard","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":139314,"username":"NadavAharon","name":"נדב אהרון","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/8e7dd6/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136846,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule/170358/59","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":498809,"name":"נדב אהרון","username":"NadavAharon","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T06:57:13.464Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI guess, but having to set every single one up with its own secret is too much work for something that should be as easy as asking the bot to do it\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":60,"post_type":1,"posts_count":29,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T06:57:13.464Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":59,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":4,"readers_count":3,"score":5.8,"yours":false,"topic_id":170358,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule","display_username":"נדב אהרון","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":136846,"username":"Andrew_Simard","name":"Andrew Simard","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/andrew_simard/{size}/120286_2.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":139314,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule/170358/60","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":498823,"name":"Andrew Simard","username":"Andrew_Simard","avatar_template":"/user_avatar/forum.cursor.com/andrew_simard/{size}/120286_2.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T07:13:52.835Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI absolutely agree. This needs to be fixed. I’m just suggesting this as a stopgap measure until they do.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve got mine set to wakeup the main bot at just after the times I have stuff scheduled, and it has been instructed to kick off any missing or late tasks for itself or any of the other bots. So it is just one cron job set to run at different times (7am, 4pm, 9pm, that sort of thing) and when the main bot gets pinged it ensures everything that is suppose to run at that time gets run. I only have a handful of scheduled tasks like this, so it works well enough for now.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eNo need to setup a separate one for each bot or each task even. It is mostly just “are you awake??” kind of thing. I’ve told my bot it is the “anti-narcolepsy protocol” until the scheduler gets properly fixed. If you ask your bot nicely it might even set it all up for you \u003cimg src=\"https://emoji.discourse-cdn.com/fluentui/thinking.png?v=15\" title=\":thinking:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":thinking:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":61,"post_type":1,"posts_count":29,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T07:18:17.375Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":60,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":5,"readers_count":4,"score":6.0,"yours":false,"topic_id":170358,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule","display_username":"Andrew Simard","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":2,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"read":true,"user_title":null,"reply_to_user":{"id":139314,"username":"NadavAharon","name":"נדב אהרון","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/8e7dd6/{size}.png"},"bookmarked":false,"actions_summary":[],"moderator":false,"admin":false,"staff":false,"user_id":136846,"hidden":false,"trust_level":0,"deleted_at":null,"user_deleted":false,"edit_reason":null,"can_view_edit_history":false,"wiki":false,"post_url":"/t/grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule/170358/61","reactions":[],"current_user_reaction":null,"reaction_users_count":0,"current_user_used_main_reaction":false,"can_accept_answer":false,"can_unaccept_answer":false,"accepted_answer":false,"topic_accepted_answer":null},{"id":498977,"name":"נדב אהרון","username":"NadavAharon","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/8e7dd6/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-09-23T10:34:47.768Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eI get it, it just doesnt really work for my use case, i need it to do a lot of polling or delayed tasks which this is t a very good solution for.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eFor example, yesterday i gave the bots a task to run a stability test on one of my environments every 10 minutes for one hour, it didnt wake up on its own for any of the scheduled test times, and this isnt a static recurring task i can just set up a wake up nudge for.\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":63,"post_type":1,"posts_count":29,"updated_at":"2026-09-23T10:34:47.768Z","reply_count":1,"reply_to_post_number":61,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":0,"reads":6,"readers_count":5,"score":6.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":170358,"topic_slug":"grok-bot-routines-dont-auto-run-on-schedule","display_usern